      "<p><b>Kimyoviy element</b> — bir xil turdagi atomlar. Hozir <b>118</b> ta element ma’lum, ~90 tasi tabiatda uchraydi.</p><p><b>Kimyoviy belgi</b> — lotincha nomning 1–2 harfi: H (vodorod), O (kislorod), C (uglerod), N (azot), Fe (temir — ferrum), Cu (mis — cuprum), Ag (kumush — argentum), Au (oltin — aurum), Na (natriy), Cl (xlor).</p><p><b>Tarqalishi (massa bo‘yicha):</b></p><ul><li><b>Yer po‘stida</b>: O ≈ 49%, Si ≈ 26%, Al ≈ 7,5%, Fe ≈ 4,7%, Ca, Na, K, Mg;</li><li><b>Inson tanasida</b>: O ≈ 65%, C ≈ 18%, H ≈ 10%, N ≈ 3%, Ca, P;</li><li><b>Havoda</b> (hajm): N ≈ 78%, O ≈ 21%, Ar ≈ 0,9%;</li><li><b>Koinotda</b>: H ≈ 74%, He ≈ 24%.</li></ul>",
